<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
<Document>
  <name>Bank Erosion Hotspot (2016-2026) - Smoothed (vector)</name>
  <description><![CDATA[Bank erosion hotspot classification, clipped to the Mula-Mutha AOI boundary so the light-green 'No Erosion' fill no longer spills onto surrounding land. Hotspot = number of year-to-year periods with detected erosion.<br/><br/><b>Pixel-smoothed vector rendition.</b> The source 30 m categorical raster was smoothed with one-hot probability resampling + argmax and vectorised as nested ordinal regions, then boundaries were rounded with Chaikin corner-cutting. Layers are stacked lowest-class-first, so the visible colour at any point is the highest hotspot class present there.]]></description>
  <open>1</open>
